{"id":211,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"品格品性と智情勇を育てる山梨学院","feature_description":"山梨学院中学校は、建学の精神に基づき、品格品性に富む豊かな心と、気魄をもって広く世界に知を求める姿勢を大切にしています。教育目的では『智と情と勇をそなえた人間の育成』を掲げ、中高一貫6年間で自分の目標を見つけ、道を切り開く力を育てる方針が公式に示されています。海外研修や学校紹介も整っており、行事や日常の導線も確認できます。","clubs":[{"id":4677,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4678,"name":"バスケットボール部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4679,"name":"バスケットボール部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4680,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4681,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4682,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4683,"name":"野球同好会","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4684,"name":"空手道部・剣道部・水泳部・新体操部・スキー部・陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4685,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4686,"name":"レゴ・ロボット部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4687,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4688,"name":"囲碁将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4689,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4690,"name":"アート部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ygjh.ed.jp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06